  "notes": "VoiceLists now lets you enable محروم مني and the per-user camera disconnect rule while nobody is in voice, including from profiles and DMs. Rules remain saved per account and resolve the correct server when the member appears.\n\nAdds a persistent camera-guard button to the top bar. Enable it per server to disconnect any other member who turns on their camera; it works while you are outside voice and requires your normal Move Members permission.\n\nRebuilds UserRadar with the full watchlist manager, Custom/Stalker/Lite/Silent presets, pinned users, per-user category overrides, searchable activity cards, daily stats, filters, message jumps, import/export, and richer message, edit, delete, typing, voice, camera, stream, presence, activity, profile, and shared-server tracking.\n\nAdds the pink articit queen profile badge for user 336713233257857024 using the supplied crown design.\n\nValidation passed: TypeScript, ESLint, production build, installer tests, packaged ASAR hashing, and release asset verification."
}

